      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like once the damage is done, you can't just \"navigate\" it away. i look at my family and i see all their sacrifices, and then i look at myself and i just see the reason they're going to be disappointed. if i just disappeared, maybe they could at least remember me as someone who tried, instead of just the one who failed them. at least then the shame would stop growing.",
